The expedition reached the northern observatory after a long climb through pine forests and granite ridges, carrying instruments for the winter survey.

![pic](http://127.0.0.1:<PORT>/assets/pic.png)

The photograph above shows the valley at dawn. See [[other-page|this other page]] for the full survey report and additional maps of the surrounding peaks.
